"Sarya is one of Davrar's original participants, from the Distal Expansion beyond Davrar."
"Her faction sought to keep Davrar a scholarly experiment and failed; she is bitter about it."
"She holds one of the eighty-nine seats of Davrar's old governing council."
"Long ago she forced a Conclave meant to make Davrar kinder, and it went badly."
"She holds divine relics strong enough to shatter Keihona."
"She has negotiated with Badud for millennia; by pact between their grids, Brox counters Badud."
"Later, she accepts Badud's deal of three continents and non-interference for an early Ending."
"Later, she sends agents to Gemore to watch Nathan Lark and the Heirs."
"Years later, her grid votes to help the Heirs, and she trains them for two weeks in Keihona."
"She names the Heirs allies of Keihona and sets their first deed: kill Badud's grid in Esebus."
"She gives the Heirs a map of Esebus marking Sussu's vault."
"She advises Nathan to take the Death of Legends class."
"After Sussu dies, her grid takes Esebus, and she promises to improve the port of Kankus."
"She kisses Eolinne, who does not return the kiss."
"She agrees to train the Ashen Accord's new Questors to fight."
"Before the Ostren war she styles the Heirs for fame with glamours."
"At the Conclave she schedules the Heirs, tests their food for poison, and avoids politics."
"Nine years later she keeps agents, some of them on the road to Questorhood."
